  fhir:DomainResource.text [
     fhir:Narrative.status [ fhir:value "extensions" ] ;
     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: ValueSet ng-hiv-int-lab-arv-prophylaxis-vs</b></p><a name=\"ng-hiv-int-lab-arv-prophylaxis-vs\"> </a><a name=\"hcng-hiv-int-lab-arv-prophylaxis-vs\"> </a><ul><li>Include these codes as defined in <a href=\"CodeSystem-ng-hiv-int-lab-form-cs.html\"><code>https://fhir-ig.digitalhealth.gov.ng/CodeSystem/ng-hiv-int-lab-form-cs</code></a><span title=\"Version is not explicitly stated, which means it is fixed to the version provided in this specification\"> version ?0.0.0</span><table class=\"none\"><tr><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Display</b></td><td><b>Definition</b></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-ng-hiv-int-lab-form-cs.html#ng-hiv-int-lab-form-cs-arv-prophylaxis-azt-nvp\">arv-prophylaxis-azt-nvp</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">AZT + NVP</td><td>Zidovudine and nevirapine prophylaxis.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-ng-hiv-int-lab-form-cs.html#ng-hiv-int-lab-form-cs-arv-prophylaxis-nvp\">arv-prophylaxis-nvp</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">NVP</td><td>Nevirapine prophylaxis.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-ng-hiv-int-lab-form-cs.html#ng-hiv-int-lab-form-cs-arv-prophylaxis-azt-3tc-nvp-ral\">arv-prophylaxis-azt-3tc-nvp-ral</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">AZT + 3TC + NVP/RAL</td><td>Zidovudine, lamivudine and nevirapine or raltegravir prophylaxis as printed on the source form.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-ng-hiv-int-lab-form-cs.html#ng-hiv-int-lab-form-cs-arv-prophylaxis-other\">arv-prophylaxis-other</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">Other ARV prophylaxis</td><td>An ARV-prophylaxis regimen not represented by another code; specify separately.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"CodeSystem-ng-hiv-int-lab-form-cs.html#ng-hiv-int-lab-form-cs-arv-prophylaxis-none\">arv-prophylaxis-none</a></td><td style=\"color: #cccccc\">No ARV prophylaxis</td><td>No ARV prophylaxis was received.</td></tr></table></li></ul></div>"
